      "widgets_values": [
        "MODE A = STILLS COME FROM MAGNIFIC (not made in Comfy any more)\n\nThe 10 Blackout stills for each clip are generated on Magnific\n(Google Nano Banana Pro, 16:9, 1k, your Magnific project)\nby the agent, using Magnific credits (75 per still,\n750 per clip). Nothing in this workflow makes stills now.\n\nWHERE THEY ARRIVE\n  <ComfyUI>\\input\\blackout\\stills\\clip_XXX\\\n    clip_XXX_s01.png ... clip_XXX_s10.png   (already 1280x720)\n    clip_XXX_contact.jpg                  (all 10, numbered)\n    raw\\                               (Magnific originals)\n    magnific.json                       (ids, prompt, sizes)\n  XXX = the 3-digit clip number (CLIP_001_name... -> clip_001).\n\nHOW TO PICK ONE\n  1. Open clip_XXX_contact.jpg (or the PNGs) in Explorer.\n  2. Pick the best: pitch black except ONE flashlight beam,\n     no leaked light in windows/screens/lamps, nothing added,\n     removed or moved, same framing as the source.\n  3. Remember its number: s07 -> chosen_option = 7 in node 2.\n  (Missing a clip's folder? Ask the agent to run stills for it.)\n\nWHAT MODE A (toggle = true) STILL DOES HERE\n  Only previews the clip's first frame (free). The old fal\n  Nano Banana Pro nodes are kept on the right as a BYPASSED\n  fallback; re-enabling them costs fal money (~$1.50/clip).\n"
      ],
      "title": "MODE A - Magnific stills: where they are and how to pick",
      "color": "#223",
      "bgcolor": "#335"
